{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Game Concept</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <strong>Bubumbu</strong>, you will help walking puzzle pieces explore various worlds in search of the place they belong. The object portrayed on the puzzle pieces gives a hint to where they may fit. The interaction and logic reminds a lot of point-and-click adventures, and the challenge similar that of a hidden objects game. The total playtime is about 30 minutes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2303420/extras/Bubumbu_11.gif?t=1741347427\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Secrets All Around</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In addition to the main puzzle mechanics, the game worlds also contain hidden things around the environment. By pressing certain details you spot in your surroundings you may discover these secrets - and then they will show up in your &quot;Island of Secrets&quot;.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2303420/extras/Bubumbu_12.gif?t=1741347427\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2303420?t=1741347427","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2303420/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1741347427","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2303420/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741347427","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2303420/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741347427","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Game Concept</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <s